'''Toshiron''' (Japanese: '''トシロン''') is one of the [[Ghost Master]]s located in the [[Sealed Fort]], located on [[GR Island]] in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game 2: The Invasion of Team GR!]] Toshiron can be found in the third of the nine statues in the main room. Players who defeat Toshiron will obtain a Present Pack, which can consist of any card that can be found in a booster pack in the game.

==Trainer Imprison Deck==
'''Trainer Imprison Deck''' (Japanese: '''トレーナーふういんデッキ''') is the deck played by Toshiron. The deck features various types of Pokémon and includes numerous cards designed to cause {{TCG|Special Condition}} or prevent Trainer cards from being played.

